Correct. For good reasons. Price / performance ratio.
A number of us feel that given proper performance people are interested.
And given a competitive price they will buy.
We are still selling a steady flow of Alphas. There is a demand.
However the performance has risen too slowly, and the prices actually went 
up under API.
