On Fri, 2002-08-09 at 14:52, Maurice Hilarius wrote:
> Have you tried locking the speed, rather than autonegotiate?
> With some switches/hubs that seems to make a difference..

I tried switching it manually from SRM, but haven't tried forcing it via
module options. I didn't feel like digging out the docs for the module
parameters, so I gave up and went home. I'll try again on Monday.

What I don't get is that it worked fine for ages. I installed all the
current errata packages before this showed up, and every single one of
those files arrived via FTP.

I'll post more if I'm still tearing my hair out in a couple of days. I'm
also going to try taking it upstairs and connecting it to a totally
different switch, too.

Thanks,
Mike.





