On Fri, 2002-08-09 at 16:07, Vakvarju wrote:
> Question: your card worked in 10 or 100 Mb/s mode?

It worked at 10 meg for a while, then died after a reboot. It should
only have ever been running in 10 meg, half duplex mode - that's what
the switch port is set to.

> As I remember this problem arised when I went to 100 Mb/s from 10 Mb/s.

I think I had ewa0_mode set to FastFD briefly, but the switch port is
forced to 10 meg, half duplex. I'm pretty sure I swapped SRM to
auto-negotiate quite a while before this problem popped up. I never
played with the module parameters from inside the system at all.

Thanks,
Mike.





