If you have a tty connection and it is only X locked up
you could try switching runlevels, this sometimes
helps restore the X window system,
as root:

'telinit 3; sleep 5; telinit 5'

or even more agressive:

'telinit 1; sleep 5; telinit 5'

Stephen Lewis

