In the sendmail.mc that was used to create it (/etc/mail/sendmail.mc) there
is a option like "DAEMON_OPTIONS(`Port=smtp,Addr=127.0.0.1, Name=MTA')"
Comment this out and rebuild, or go into sendmail.cf and look for:
O DaemonPortOptions= ...

Remove the Addr= portion of it...


